Albatropolis has been freed and Big G and Putzki Jr are running for president!
Who will win? Who will cheat?

This DLC features:
- three new politician costumes;
- two new playable characters (General Puff and Putzki Jr);
- two new PvP Dojo Debate Rooms;
- And the all new Assimilator Gun for mind controlling your victims during your Rescue Missions!

New characters and items are only available in  this bundle!

